<title>UK: Copper quiet in LME PM, zinc back above $1,500.</title>
<headline>Copper quiet in LME PM, zinc back above $1,500.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Little changed from softer AM kerb close. Support at $2,250. Cash/threes narrow to around $180 backwardation. ZINC - Buoyant, back above $1,500. ALUMINIUM - Just firmer. TIN/NICKEL - Hovering around lows after coming under selling pressure early on. ALLOY - Bounces off lows. LEAD - Off lows.</p>
</text>
